// A story scene's or the intro's stage, each frame: when a stage is pending (0x8015CCD4, set by set_scene_stage) builds stage 0x8015C8E0 (func_8001B3E4) and clears the flag; then with `keep_hidden` 0 and a real stage (below 0x19) shows it -- the arena (show_arena) for stages below 10, else func_8002173C(1) -- and clears the letterbox level 0x80106614 (draw_letterbox_bars, drawn by draw_menu_text_queue); otherwise (no stage, or keep_hidden) sets it to 0x3FF, the bars full. Callers update_scene_view, play_scene_script, run_intro_frame. The mod hooks it (hooks_recomp.c arcade_on_scene_request) to drop a pending 255 'no scene', which func_8001B3E4 read past its tables.
